<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR PLANS NO 1996 PAYOUT.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR PLANS NO 1996 PAYOUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish leather company Chemiskor SA plans no 1996 dividend and wants to earmark this year's net profit for investments, the president of the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>Chemiskor expects its net profit at 700,000 zlotys in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We (the management) will propose to earmark all the net profit for investments,&quot; Jerzy Stepien told Reuters.</p>
<p>Last year Chemiskor paid 0.6 zlotys dividend per share.</p>
<p>Stepien said Chemiskor planned to buy two or three Polish tanneries next year.</p>
<p>-- Malgorzata Rzepka +48 22 653 9700</p>
